        "ggTfdU5cHqr_text": "<p>At Amun Organics, we are dedicated to delivering your products with care and efficiency.</p><p><strong>Processing Time: </strong>Orders are typically processed within 1-3 business days.<br><strong>Shipping Rates &amp; Delivery: </strong>Shipping costs are calculated at checkout based on your location and selected shipping method. Delivery times vary by region.</p><p><br><strong>International Shipping:&nbsp;</strong></p><p>We currently ship worldwide. International orders may be subject to customs fees, duties, or taxes, which are the responsibility of the customer.<br>Tracking Your Order: Once your order has shipped, you will receive a tracking number via email to monitor its journey to your doorstep.</p><p><br><strong>Returns &amp; Exchanges:</strong><br>We stand behind the quality of our products and want you to be fully satisfied with your purchase.</p><p>Returns: Due to the nature of our handcrafted organic products, we do not accept returns. However, if you receive a damaged or defective item, please contact us within 7 days of delivery for a resolution.<br>Exchanges: If an item arrives damaged or incorrect, we will gladly replace it. Please provide photos and details of the issue when reaching out to our support team.</p><p><br><strong>Refunds:&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Refunds are issued only in cases of damaged, defective, or incorrect items. Approved refunds will be processed back to the original payment method.</p><p><br>For any questions regarding shipping or returns, feel free to contact our customer support team at [insert contact email]. We’re here to help!</p>"
